# Documents / ingested corpora.
# Scoped to the directories that actually hold them. A bare `**.json` here
# matches EVERY .json in the repo — it silently swallowed package.json,
# tsconfig.json and the Go golden fixtures, each of which then needed its own
# negation to claw back. Keep these rules narrow rather than re-adding them.
**.pdf
**/data/**.json
**/data/**.jsonl
**/documents/**.json
**/documents/**.jsonl